# Fix Codex Session-Capture Delivery

## Step

Coverage research found Codex raw transcripts current on flagg and blaine but
index delivery dead since ~2026-06-07/21 (blaine hook reports missing
session/path; flagg has a 17.3MB transcript unindexed). Diagnose the capture
script/hook, restore delivery to Central `/api/runs`, backfill the stale
window, and verify freshness ✅ on both machines. Receipts in
[session-capture-coverage-2026-07](../../resources/session-capture-coverage-2026-07.svx).

## Result (2026-08-19)

Closed as moved outside this effort, not as fleet-complete. Flagg Codex delivery now has a fresh accepted and searchable Stop-hook proof. Blaine still belongs to the separate capture/archive repair surface. The 2026-08-19 finish-line amendment makes accepted Runs this effort's input and explicitly excludes runtime transport repair.
